              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Teak oil penetrates and nourishes the wood for a rich hand-rubbed glow, but it contains little UV protection, weathers away quickly outdoors, and can actually promote mildew on outdoor teak. Teak sealer is built to preserve the golden color long term, carrying heavy UV blockers and mildew inhibitors and lasting far longer outdoors. Use oil indoors or on protected furniture, and a sealer for outdoor and marine teak.
